# Issue Workflow Rule

- Treat `docs/issue-workflow.md` as the source of truth for issue execution.
- Do not start implementation unless there is an active issue.
- Every executable issue must have one native GitHub parent relationship to an epic.
- Keep issues small; split broad work into child issues before coding.
- Ensure `area:*`, `priority:*`, and `type:*` labels are present before execution.
- When work is complete, ensure closure criteria from `docs/issue-workflow.md` are met.
